---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="How It Works" description="Five steps between funded and healed. See how Restore the Last delivers nervous system restoration to those who need it most.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-white section-padding border-b border-primary/10">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <p class="label text-primary mb-4">How It Works</p>
      <div class="gold-line mb-8"></div>
      <h1 class="text-dark text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold leading-tight max-w-3xl">
        Five steps between funded and healed.
      </h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Steps -->
  <section class="bg-offwhite section-padding">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <div class="space-y-12">

          <!-- Step 1 -->
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-primary/10 p-8 md:p-10">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
              <p class="font-serif text-5xl font-bold text-primary/20 leading-none flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">01</p>
              <div>
                <p class="label text-gold-deep mb-2">Find Projects</p>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-dark mb-4">We identify where impact is possible.</h2>
                <p class="text-body leading-relaxed mb-4">
                  We find organizations where this technology can do the most good, then build a practical plan with them.
                </p>
                <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
                  Not every organization is ready. We look for established facilities with community trust, staff willing to learn, and leadership committed to outcomes — not optics.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 2 -->
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-primary/10 p-8 md:p-10">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
              <p class="font-serif text-5xl font-bold text-primary/20 leading-none flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">02</p>
              <div>
                <p class="label text-gold-deep mb-2">Fund</p>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-dark mb-4">Donors fund real work in the field.</h2>
                <p class="text-body leading-relaxed mb-4">
                  Give to a specific project, or into the shared fund. Either way, you see where every dollar lands. We name the facility, the population, and the country — a destination, not a category.
                </p>
                <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
                  Pooled gifts let us move the moment a facility is ready — no waiting for one project to hit its number. Every project is published, with outcomes attached.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 3 -->
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-primary/10 p-8 md:p-10">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
              <p class="font-serif text-5xl font-bold text-primary/20 leading-none flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">03</p>
              <div>
                <p class="label text-gold-deep mb-2">Deploy</p>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-dark mb-4">Technology placed where it's needed most.</h2>
                <p class="text-body leading-relaxed mb-4">
                  The technology goes directly into partner facilities — children's homes, residential campuses, recovery centers. No referrals needed. Residents just walk down the hall.
                </p>
                <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
                  On-campus delivery works better than clinic referral. It's safer, more consistent, and far more people take part.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 4 -->
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-primary/10 p-8 md:p-10">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
              <p class="font-serif text-5xl font-bold text-primary/20 leading-none flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">04</p>
              <div>
                <p class="label text-gold-deep mb-2">Train</p>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-dark mb-4">Staff trained to deliver with confidence.</h2>
                <p class="text-body leading-relaxed mb-4">
                  We train on-site staff hands-on until they can run sessions with confidence. The goal is independence — their program, their schedule, their people.
                </p>
                <p class="text-body leading-relaxed mb-6">
                  One trained practitioner can serve 160–200 clients per year to completion. A single machine with a part-time operator can transform a facility.
                </p>
                <img
                  src="/placeholder-young-adults.jpg"
                  alt="Illustrative photo — direct neurofeedback in a partner setting"
                  class="rounded-xl shadow-sm w-full max-w-sm object-cover"
                />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 5 -->
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-primary/10 p-8 md:p-10">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
              <p class="font-serif text-5xl font-bold text-primary/20 leading-none flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">05</p>
              <div>
                <p class="label text-gold-deep mb-2">Support</p>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-dark mb-4">We don't walk away after deployment.</h2>
                <p class="text-body leading-relaxed mb-4">
                  We stay with each partner long term: troubleshooting, encouragement, retraining when staff change, and a growing network of practitioners doing the same work.
                </p>
                <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
                  The goal is a self-sustaining program that outlasts our involvement — and eventually expands on its own.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Donor Experience -->
  <section class="bg-light section-padding">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="label text-primary mb-6">The Donor Experience</p>
        <h2 class="mb-8">You see exactly where your money goes.</h2>
        <p class="text-body text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Inspired by the Charity: Water model — proof that donors give more when they can see the project, track the progress, and witness the outcome.
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-primary/10 flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-1">
              <span class="text-white text-xs font-bold">1</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-h4 font-serif font-bold mb-1">Give to a project — or to the fund</h3>
              <p class="text-body text-sm">Fund a specific project directly, or give to the shared fund that backs them all. Either way, every project is published — real facilities, real populations, real costs.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-primary/10 flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-1">
              <span class="text-white text-xs font-bold">2</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-h4 font-serif font-bold mb-1">Receive updates</h3>
              <p class="text-body text-sm">Progress reports as the deployment moves from funded to active to complete.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-primary/10 flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-1">
              <span class="text-white text-xs font-bold">3</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-h4 font-serif font-bold mb-1">See outcomes</h3>
              <p class="text-body text-sm">Real numbers from real sessions. Symptom reduction. Recovery rates. Stories.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-deep text-white section-padding text-center">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h2 class="text-white text-3xl mb-6">Fund the next deployment.</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/give" class="btn-gold text-lg">Give now</a>
        <a href="/partners" class="btn-primary text-lg">Become a partner</a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-white/70 text-sm mt-6">
        Or see a deployment in motion — <a href="/projects" class="underline hover:text-white transition-colors">current projects</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
